# P4: Scale snap on Tracker+ and Mini (the list moves by tap Down, the Mini has no encoder, expect peek snap0 reads scaleSnapMode[0] from the devtools console). Project Settings, the Scale snap group (Enter), Track 1 to Nearest, the page's value column counts the tracks.
# Mini (P8): no File key, Menu box 6 (Down, Right x2 from the Pattern box) opens File, F7 is Project Settings.
title: Scale snap on the Mini (P8)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

wait 1500ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Down
wait 200ms
tap Right x2
wait 300ms
release Menu
wait 1000ms
tap F7
wait 1000ms
expect text "4 FX Slots"
tap Down x13
wait 400ms
expect text "Scale snap"
expect peek snap0 0
tap F8
wait 800ms
shot snap-group
tap F8
wait 500ms
tap Down
wait 500ms
tap F8
wait 800ms
shot snap-nearest
expect peek snap0 1
